{"code":"245620","name":"EDGC","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"생명과학도구및서비스","sector_desc":"바이오 연구 장비·위탁생산(CDMO)·임상 대행. 글로벌 제약사 수주가 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2013년 이원의료재단과 Diagnomics와의 합작으로 설립된 글로벌 바이오 유전체 빅데이터 기업임. 2020년 이디지씨헬스케어와의 합병으로 체외진단 시약 및 장비 분야로 사업을 확장하였고, 2021년에는 캐나다의 건강기능식품업체 NLN 인수로 맞춤형 건기식 플랫폼을 구축함. 주요 사업으로 비침습 산전 진단검사 '나이스', NGS 기반 액체생검 '온코캐치', DTC 유전체 혈통분석 '유후' 등을 운영하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-11-27","n_days":300,"close":741.0,"open":741.0,"high":741.0,"low":741.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":78.5542,"ret_250":78.5542,"ma20":741.0,"ma60":741.0,"ma120":724.7,"ma200":600.82,"close_vs_ma200":23.3314,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"ma50":741.0,"ma150":662.76,"ma200_chg_21":6.0414,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":null,"slope_120":41.0909,"r2_120":0.1425,"slope_250":136.9936,"r2_250":0.7442,"high52":741.0,"low52":415.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"from_low52":78.5542,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":0.0,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"stop_atr2_pct":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.47,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-7.0,"op_margin_q":-53.8462,"op_qoq":0.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-75.0,"rev_yoy":-27.7778,"op_trend_4q":-3.871,"fin_period":"202609","roe":309.59,"debt_ratio":73.32,"per":1.85,"pbr":7.72,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.47,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nx